Follow the root `AGENTS.md` and the requested study. SwarmHarm uses `swarmharm/README.md` and `swarmharm/docs/research/mechanism-input-status.json`; the portable SwarmForm handoff uses `rollouts/README.md`; current SwarmForm results use `swarmform/docs/formation-readiness.json`. Do not substitute one study's population, input inventory or routing for the other's. Published runs use their own sealed registration.
